From cdf00bb32b01fdd6652d9845e5b2a5b694bccf8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:58:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Fix crash on any action by adding robust error handling
 and legal move validation

- .gitignore: Added __pycache__/ to ignore compiled Python files
- main.py: Wrapped `add_row` call in try-except block to prevent application crash when the engine throws an exception during row addition, triggering proper game over state instead
- main.py: Implemented `legal_moves()` method that simulates moves on a game copy to identify valid actions without mutating the original state or risking Game Over from invalid clicks
- main.py: Updated `try_move()` to validate source/destination pairs against `legal_moves()` before execution, preventing crashes caused by attempting illegal moves that overflow the board
- main.py: Enhanced mouse event handling (`mousePressEvent`) to correctly identify top cards for selection and handle empty column targets gracefully
---
 .gitignore                       |   2 +-
 __pycache__/main.cpython-312.pyc | Bin 33652 -> 39874 bytes
 main.py                          |  97 +++++++++++++++++++++----------
 3 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

